<title>USA: Stratus CEO starts search for replacement.</title>
<headline>Stratus CEO starts search for replacement.</headline>
<dateline>MARLBORO, Mass. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stratus Computer Inc said that its chairman, chief executive and founder, Bill Foster, started a search for a new CEO of the company.</p>
<p>Foster has been CEO since 1980.</p>
<p>He said he hopes to have a new CEO in place by the end of the year.</p>
<p>When the new CEO is appointed, Foster will continue as the company's chairman, he added.</p>
